        "TileImage": "$($repository fdb20afd-1a6e-4b94-8023-c263c5f7b3b6).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47. Caruso has created a virus that threatens to destroy the East Coast of the US, demanding a huge ransom. Our informant has told us that the virus is hidden in an underground cave. Use Dr. Quartz Tan's Mini-Nuke Golf to destroy it, and eliminate the two lead virologists in the process. To avoid raising suspicion, use different disguises to kill each target.Bring one golf-bomb before mission start so we can apply for reibursement. Good luck.",
